(filter predicate on a poset, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\)</span> (sequence of filter members)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7StableFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7StableFilter}_S\\)</span> (stable-filter predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}stable\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7StableFilter}_S(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(\\omega),\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega):A\\subseteq B\\})\\land\\emptyset\\notin\\mathcal F\\land\n\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,\\mathcal F)\\to\n\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\setminus s(n))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}stable\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7StableFilter}_S(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(\\omega),\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega):A\\subseteq B\\})\\land\\emptyset\\notin\\mathcal F\\land\n\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,\\mathcal F)\\to\n\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\setminus s(n))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC filter definition.</li>\n<li>Countable families are quantified as set-coded functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\omega\\to\\mathcal F\">\\(s:\\omega\\to\\mathcal F\\)</span>, so every use of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(n)\">\\(s(n)\\)</span> is typed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S$ (filter predicate on a poset, see [[58-df-filter]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":""